          "duration": 7.354333,
          "src": "audio/clips/queen_og_heroes_entry_1__queen.mp3",
          "transcripts": {
            "en": [
              "These fortifications look stalwart enough.",
              "Though ... I had thought thus about my own walls."
            ],
            "de": [
              "Diese Befestigungen wirken hinlänglich wehrhaft.",
              "Doch ... dasselbe habe ich von meinen eigenen Mauern gedacht."
            ],
            "es": [
              "Estas fortificaciones parecen bastante sólidas.",
              "Aunque... yo pensaba lo mismo de mis propios muros."
            ],
            "fr": [
              "Ces fortifications ont l'air assez solides....",
              "Cela dit... je pensais la même chose de mes propres murs."
            ],
            "it": [
              "Queste fortificazioni sembrano abbastanza solide.",
              "Anche se... avevo pensato così delle mie stesse mura."
            ],
            "ja": [
              "この防備なら 頑丈そうね。",
              "とはいえ… 私の城の壁も 頑丈だと思ってたけれど…"
            ],
            "ko": [
              "이 방어벽들은 충분히 튼튼해 보이네.",
              "그렇지만... 나 역시 내 성벽을 보고 그렇게 생각했었지."
            ],
            "pt-br": [
              "Essas fortificações parecem bem robustas.",
              "Embora... eu tenha pensado o mesmo das minhas próprias paredes."
            ],
            "ru": [
              "Эти укрепления кажутся довольно надёжными.",
              "Хотя... я так же думала и о своих стенах."
            ],
            "s-cn": [
              "这些防御工事看着还算坚固。",
              "不过……我从前对自己的城墙也是这么想的。"
            ],
            "t-cn": [
              "這些防禦工事看著還算堅固。",
              "不過……我從前對自己的城牆也是這麼想的。"
            ]
          },
